-# The S&S program's rejection template (from Sage, 2026-10-29). Available:
-# @name (the applicant's real name, or username), @course, and @manager (the
-# scholars_and_scientists_manager; nil while the email comes from the
-# Dashboard's own address, in which case the signature is the organization).
%link{rel: 'stylesheet', href:'/mailer.css'}
%table.row
  %tbody
    %tr
      %th
        %table
          %tr
            %td.main-content
              %p.paragraph= "Hi #{@name},"
              %p.paragraph
                Thanks so much for your interest in our Wiki Scholars course. We had a large
                number of applicants for this course, and unfortunately, we are unable to move
                forward with your application at this time. We will be in touch if this changes
                for any reason.
              %p.paragraph
                For now, please check
                %a.link{href: 'https://learn.wikiedu.org'} learn.wikiedu.org
                for more course opportunities.
              %p.paragraph
                \--
                %br
                - if @manager
                  = @manager.real_name.presence || @manager.username
                  %br
                  Scholars &amp; Scientists Program Manager
                  %br
                WikiEducation
                %br
                @wikieducation
                - if @manager
                  %br
                  %a.link{href: "mailto:#{@manager.email}"}= @manager.email
